.TH "SOPLOS-REPO-SELECTOR" "1" "2026-10-19" "Soplos Linux" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
soplos-repo-selector \- Advanced APT repository and mirror manager for Soplos Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B soplos-repo-selector
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B soplos-repo-selector
is the official APT repository and package source management tool for Soplos Linux.
Built with Tauri 2, Rust, and Svelte architecture, it provides an intuitive, reliable, and secure graphical interface to manage package archives:
.IP \[bu] 2
Inspects, enables, and disables configured repositories across \fI/etc/apt/sources.list\fR and \fI/etc/apt/sources.list.d/\fR.
.IP \[bu]
Modernizes legacy one-line \fI.list\fR configurations into modern Debian DEB822 \fI.sources\fR format.
.IP \[bu]
Sources Generator: lets users switch mirrors, enable source code repositories, and configure non-free components.
.IP \[bu]
Integrated real-world mirror speed tester to discover and apply the highest bandwidth Debian mirrors.
.IP \[bu]
Complete GPG keyring management: import, inspect, and remove signing keys with automatic detection of unused keys.
.IP \[bu]
Polkit-integrated privilege escalation for safe and controlled modifications to system configuration.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show summary of options.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/apt/sources.list
Main Debian APT repository configuration file.
.TP
.I /etc/apt/sources.list.d/
Directory for modular APT repository files (.sources and .list).
.TP
.I /etc/apt/keyrings/
Standard location for trusted repository signing keys.
.TP
.I /usr/share/polkit-1/actions/org.soplos.reposelector.policy
Polkit policy defining administrative permissions.
